        {
          "text": " Ku yaateekateekire kwambuka Akaya, ab'eishe-emwe baamugumya, baahandiikira abeegi kumwakiira; ku yaahikireyo, embabazi za Ruhanga zaamubaasisa kuhwera abo abaabaire baikiriize; ",
